Z||000009||skitime||08-21-2001||09:54 PM||||I wish I could be there to help. I like traveling but work start tomorrow.  Your manifold crack on the trunk side is the easy side. The bolts are reachable with a short extension (3"). If you get part way done and get stuck you can still take it to the shop but if you complete it you saved a bundle. Maybe enough to come to the BBQ.  How about driving it down and we fix it here?  ||||reg||1
